<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor rate were</p>
<p>flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was unchanged at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 30 fix	   April 29 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.03 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.32 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.44 pct		3.44 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
